<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Don't Take The Night</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">THE DRIVER ERA, Ross Lynch, Rocky</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">I'd Rather Die</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3lGUTTW6IF7NQ5PZ4y3M6Z</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.849" end="00:26.349">Running round town</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.830" end="00:27.330">Just to find out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.749" end="00:28.578">The way that we roll</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.578" end="00:30.372">Carry on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.372" end="00:33.253">Just carry on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.253" end="00:36.834">Losing my mind just about time to let it all go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.834" end="00:38.839">Before you know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.839" end="00:40.846">Before you know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.846" end="00:43.672">So smooth baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.672" end="00:45.298">Got that liquid luck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.298" end="00:47.415">When you're talking to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.415" end="00:49.541">I'm intoxicated</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.541" end="00:51.498">Ugh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.498" end="00:59.498">Now that the sunlights fallen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.860" end="01:07.860">Our time to celebrate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.221" end="01:16.221">We've waited for this moment</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.548" end="01:24.548">Don't take the night away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.609" end="01:33.109">Calling my name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.595" end="01:34.095">Its all the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.618" end="01:35.381">End of the day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.381" end="01:37.146">Finding out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.146" end="01:39.885">What its all about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.885" end="01:41.385">Touching my skin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.972" end="01:42.472">Feel it within</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.948" end="01:43.564">Lossing control</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.564" end="01:45.487">And I'm freaking out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.487" end="01:47.657">I'm freaking out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.657" end="01:50.491">So smooth baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.491" end="01:52.078">Got that liquid luck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.078" end="01:54.142">When you're talking to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.142" end="01:56.271">I'm intoxicated</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.271" end="01:58.843">So smooth baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.843" end="02:00.434">Got that liquid luck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.434" end="02:02.502">When you're talking to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.502" end="02:04.501">I'm intoxicated</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.501" end="02:06.602">Ugh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.602" end="02:14.602">Now that the sunlights fallen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.964" end="02:22.964">Our time to celebrate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.345" end="02:31.345">We've waited for this moment</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.645" end="02:39.522">Don't take the night away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.522" end="02:43.683">I cant even lie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.683" end="02:47.850">Gotchu on my mind you ain't leaving</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.850" end="02:51.738">Happens every time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.738" end="02:56.718">I wish i could rewind this evening（ugh）</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.718" end="03:04.718">Now that the sunlights fallen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.042" end="03:13.042">Our time to celebrate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.405" end="03:21.405">We've waited for this moment</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:21.743" end="03:28.638">Don't take the night away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:28.638" end="03:32.638" /></div></body></tt>